WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:04.960
As one of the six original Avengers, Scarlett
Johansson has been playing Black Widow, otherwise

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:07.840
known as Natasha Romanoff , for the better
part of a decade.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:12.520
But being one of the fittest forces in the
MCU didn't come easily… at all.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:18.860
Scarlett Johansson made her MCU debut back
in 2010, when she first portrayed Black Widow

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:19.760
in Iron Man 2.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.740
Since then, she's had to maintain a high level
of fitness.

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:27.880
Following the release of Avengers: Endgame
in April 2019, her personal trainer Eric Johnson

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:29.260
told The Hollywood Reporter:

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:33.060
"Scarlett always wants to be within three
weeks out of her peak condition."

00:00:33.269 --> 00:00:36.980
Of course, she's taken on plenty of other
physically demanding roles outside of the

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:40.420
Marvel Universe, like her roles in Lucy and
Ghost in the Shell.

00:00:40.649 --> 00:00:45.080
As she told E! News, getting herself in fighting
shape for Ghost in the Shell was no walk in

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:45.700
the park:

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.820
"Going to the gym, eating clean, and working
a long day and then going to bed and sleeping

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:53.780
well and getting up and doing it the next
day…"

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:57.999
Even though Johansson was a total stranger
to the gym when she was cast as Black Widow,

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.200
it sounds like they're old friends now.

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:01.860
As she told The Hollywood Reporter:

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:05.620
"The gift of fitness has been one of the best
parts about working for Marvel.

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:09.030
I am stronger and more capable now than I
was 10 years ago."

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:12.220
So how did she go from being a total noob
to getting totally ripped?

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:16.280
As her trainer Eric Johnson points out, Black
Widow is no ordinary role:

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:21.200
"We're trying to create this crazy comic book
hero in real life with [someone] who's normal."

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:23.700
The workout routine is truly extraordinary.

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:25.100
Let's see if you think you can handle it.

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:31.200
The actress has been training with Johnson
since 2009, but working out didn't necessarily

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:32.380
come naturally to her.

00:01:32.630 --> 00:01:37.420
In 2019, Johnson told The Hollywood Reporter
that her first rope climb was something of

00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:38.180
a disaster:

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:43.170
"On the way up, she kneed me in the face and
gave me a nice bloody nose, she was celebrating

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:45.420
and I'm fighting back tears, gushing blood."

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:46.840
But she learned quick.

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:51.260
Johansson was reportedly way more competent
by the time she filmed The Avengers, according

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:53.060
to Hollywood stuntwoman Heidi Moneymaker.

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:56.220
Incidentally, Heidi's sister Renae is also
a stuntwoman.

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:58.600
"Yes, that is our real last name.

00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:00.380
We were born with it."

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:03.200
In 2012, Heidi told Shape magazine,

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:06.509
"[Johansson] is one of my favorite actresses
I have ever worked with.

00:02:06.509 --> 00:02:09.550
She works very hard and picks things up really
fast."

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:15.120
Scarlett Johansson developed a great relationship
with Heidi Moneymaker right off the bat.

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:18.980
Strictly speaking, Moneymaker was hired to
do things Johansson couldn't and wouldn't

00:02:18.980 --> 00:02:23.010
do… but in the end, Moneymaker taught the
actress that she could do a lot of the stunts

00:02:23.010 --> 00:02:23.500
herself.

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:28.240
"Heidi was like my beacon of hope because
she, like, lit the way and was incredible.

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:31.290
Heidi is so creative in her movement.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:32.980
And all the movements really tell a story."

00:02:33.349 --> 00:02:38.060
When the pair reconvened for 2012's The Avengers,
they took their working relationship to the

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:41.880
next level and squeezed in sneaky work-out
sessions between takes.

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:46.240
With hand-to-hand combat and weapons training
on the agenda, it was still hard work.

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:47.440
Moneymaker told Shape:

00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:51.900
"Scarlett is such a professional and works
incredibly hard, so she learned all her fights

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.120
and performed them with perfect execution."

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:59.020
The words "bodybuilding" and "veganism" don't
usually go hand in hand.

00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:03.320
But more people are discovering just how beneficial
the diet can be while training, including

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:04.820
Thor actor Chris Hemsworth.

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:10.720
The stacked Aussie star went vegan while training
for 2012's The Avengers and so did Johansson.

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:11.720
Well, almost.

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:16.520
According to Johansson's former trainer Bobby
Strom, the actress was on a, quote, "mostly

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:17.720
vegan" diet at the time.

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:20.590
In an interview with Ecorazzi, Johansson quipped:

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:25.209
"After lots of fighting and training and raw
vegan food you can fit into a cat suit."

00:03:25.209 --> 00:03:28.780
She ate lots of kale as she tried to get fit
for the first Avengers film.

00:03:28.780 --> 00:03:31.030
But when the shoot was done, so was the vegan
diet.

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:32.620
She confessed to Fox News:

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:34.140
"Buffalo chicken wings.

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:35.260
I am addicted to them."

00:03:36.459 --> 00:03:41.069
Scarlett Johansson's next appearance as Black
Widow came in 2014's Captain America: The

00:03:41.069 --> 00:03:41.720
Winter Soldier.

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:46.280
Starring alongside super-ripped actor Chris
Evans is likely to make even the most confident

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:49.940
performer feel inadequate, but Johansson clearly
rose to the challenge.

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:52.440
Talking to Elle in 2013, she revealed:

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:56.180
"I like lifting weights and doing exercises
to work my core muscles.

00:03:56.180 --> 00:03:58.200
To be honest, I work out like a guy!"

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:02.360
It's this heavy focus on weightlifting paired
with her strict diet that gets Johansson where

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:03.409
she needs to be.

00:04:03.409 --> 00:04:05.140
Johansson told Access Hollywood:

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:10.099
"It's boring 5 a.m. workouts and salad and
chicken and nothing else, pretty much.

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:13.740
It's that old tried and true 'work-out-like-a-dude-and-eat-like-a-rabbit.'"

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:18.440
Johansson also followed that routine when
it was time to get in shape for 2015's Avengers:

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:19.240
Age of Ultron:

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:23.620
"We picked up with the same program we'd used
for Iron Man 2 and it had a proven history."

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:29.390
Scarlett Johansson took a rather extreme approach
to training for Avengers: Infinity War and

00:04:29.390 --> 00:04:30.120
Endgame.

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:34.340
In an interview with Harper's Bazaar, her
trainer Eric Jok hnson revealed Johansson

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:36.759
would often fast for 12 hours a day.

00:04:36.759 --> 00:04:37.759
Sometimes even longer.

00:04:37.759 --> 00:04:42.590
"At moments we pushed beyond that to 14 to
15 hours depending on the filming schedule."

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:47.170
Johnson spilled even more dirt on Johansson's
diet to The Hollywood Reporter, claiming Johansson

00:04:47.170 --> 00:04:51.380
dropped carbs in the days leading up to the
shoot in order to get some extra enhancement

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:52.180
on her cuts.

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:56.760
That's just the kind of ruthlessly sneaky
maneuver we've come to expect from Black Widow,

00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:57.260
isn't it?

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:58.560
"I adore you."

